    "title": "Shortest Subarray With Sum At Least K",
    "category": "Prefix Sum",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given an array of integers and an integer K, determine the length of the shortest non-empty contiguous subarray whose sum is at least K. If no such subarray exists, print -1.",
    "input": "\u2022 First line contains N and K. \u2022 Second line contains N integers.",
    "output": "\u2022 Print the minimum length.",
    "constraints": "\u2022 1 \u2264 N \u2264 2 \u00d7 10^5 \u2022 -10^9 \u2264 Ai \u2264 10^9"
